    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm just really scared to go to the hospital for no reason. this feels almost exactly like the migraines i get, just a bit more intense. like, i've had them do this before where my vision gets weird and i feel shaky. are you sure it's not just a massive aura? i'd really rather just take some extra tylenol and sleep it off if it's just a migraine.",
